      <activity id="c5748b3e-d625-54b8-822e-20ff87722fcd" activityNameId="259852de-9526-5a5a-a09f-0b7a19f65f17" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Methyl acrylate, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Methyl acrylate, at plant
The process "methyl acrylate, at plant, GLO" is modelled for the production of  methyl acrylate  from acrylic acid in the world.  Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation. Energy consumptions and emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 000096-33-3; 
Formula: C4H6O2; 
UUID: a36006c3-a83c-360e-a0c5-0ca4f7309827
Production of methyl acrylate including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for the world.
Technology: Esterification of acrylic acid
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Standard values 
Extrapolations: Energy consumptions and emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a36006c3-a83c-360e-a0c5-0ca4f7309827.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
